                <opener><dateline rendition="#center">[Telegram.—<placeName>Vigo</placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1865-02-13">February 13,
                        1865</date>.]</dateline></opener>
                <p><hi rendition="#italic">To the United States Minister:</hi></p>
                <p>The frigate Niagara has just arrived at Corunna,</p>
